WEBVTT

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:12.670
I'm going to be your teacher from now on.

00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:17.410
It's my first time, so please be gentle.

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:22.790
In any case, let's work hard
together to find our sweet spot.

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:26.960
Are the elders messing with me?
What's wrong with this lady?

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:32.840
Let's go, I've got everything ready
for you at my Amorphic Peak.

00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:34.340
Sure.

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:41.500
Are you not feeling well?
Would it help to suck on my breasts?

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.480
But no more than that, okay?

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:48.230
Huh? What are you even saying? Enough
of this sexual harassment, you old hag.

00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:52.670
I was just trying to cheer you up!

00:00:52.670 --> 00:00:54.110
Is something troubling you?

00:00:54.510 --> 00:00:59.640
My cultivation...Is everything going to work out with my Void Spirit Base?

00:00:59.640 --> 00:01:00.790
Don't sweat it!

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:04.250
Since that idiotic chief put it all on me,

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:07.740
I'll take responsibility for you no matter what!

00:01:07.740 --> 00:01:11.660
It's just a Void Spirit Base, nothing that fazes me.

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.090
Okay, well if you say so.

00:01:16.140 --> 00:01:19.410
I'm Oriku. Nice to meet you.

00:01:19.410 --> 00:01:23.640
Obu, your teacher from here on out.

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:24.730
Pleased to meet you.

00:01:25.750 --> 00:01:26.690
Let's go.

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:29.810
We'll talk on the way.

00:01:30.730 --> 00:01:35.110
Reiken Mountain is where the Ki
of the whole Sokei region gathers.

00:01:35.110 --> 00:01:39.840
It might not seem like it from
the outside, but there are 12 peaks.

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:43.210
All perfect places for cultivation.

00:01:43.210 --> 00:01:49.960
These include, Stellar Peak, Luminous Peak,
and Ethereal Peak which are ranked the highest.

00:01:50.680 --> 00:01:53.920
Following those three, is my Amorphic Peak.

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:57.340
The Ki should be more than
enough, for just the two of us.

00:01:57.800 --> 00:01:59.340
What was that over there?

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:02.340
You mean the trees and stuff?

00:02:03.080 --> 00:02:06.810
Years ago, I sold them off to pay a debt.

00:02:06.810 --> 00:02:08.850
I didn't buy any new seeds so...

00:02:09.210 --> 00:02:13.860
But it's no big deal. It'll be a forest again in four to five hundred years, right?

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:18.240
That <i>is </i>a big deal! No wonder the other elders treat you like you're useless.

00:02:19.880 --> 00:02:23.240
Here we are! Behold, my castle!

00:02:23.650 --> 00:02:25.080
Pathetic!

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:28.830
Although, I guess I shouldn't be
surprised at this point.

00:02:29.680 --> 00:02:31.380
Let me give you a run down of the elders.

00:02:31.380 --> 00:02:34.180
Among the 10 elders of the Heavenly Sword Hall,

00:02:34.180 --> 00:02:37.820
I rank 5th, sorta middle ground.

00:02:37.820 --> 00:02:40.590
The technique of my cultivation is my self-created, Amorphic Technique.

00:02:40.590 --> 00:02:42.620
Self-created?

00:02:42.620 --> 00:02:44.600
Teacher, what stage of cultivation are you at?

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:47.750
JinDan stage. Impressed?

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:49.100
That's low!

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:52.480
I'm so unimpressed I'm at a loss for words.

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:54.610
So, what about the other elders?

00:02:55.450 --> 00:03:01.420
The Chief is three stages away
from the top, the Semi-Deity Stage.

00:03:01.420 --> 00:03:04.640
The others are all four stages away,
at the Nascent Soul Stage.

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:08.870
It's almost embarrassing that we
only have one Semi-Deity elder.

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:11.950
You're the lowest, at the stage of JinDan.

00:03:11.950 --> 00:03:13.630
Aren't you the most embarrassing?

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:18.340
This will be your room from now on.

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:21.800
Now that I've given you
a tour of the place, let's eat.

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:23.390
I'll treat you today.

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:24.990
Today?

00:03:24.990 --> 00:03:27.180
You mean I'll have to cook for
myself starting tomorrow?

00:03:27.730 --> 00:03:32.990
Don't worry about it! Although the land is barren, there are still some lizards left to hunt!

00:03:32.990 --> 00:03:34.940
I didn't come here to learn wilderness survival!

00:03:36.060 --> 00:03:38.480
Did you guys hear about the Celestial Gathering?

00:03:38.870 --> 00:03:39.880
Yeah.

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:41.830
Someone had so much potential,

00:03:41.830 --> 00:03:44.710
he immediately got to become a Legacy Disciple.

00:03:44.710 --> 00:03:46.370
It's Elder Obu.

00:03:46.880 --> 00:03:49.500
Which means that kid is the Legacy Disciple.

00:03:52.360 --> 00:03:55.670
They're eating, is that part of their cultivation?

00:03:55.670 --> 00:03:58.980
Why would an elder bother to come
to the cafeteria for outer-court disciples?

00:03:58.980 --> 00:04:01.130
To experience how normal people eat?

00:04:01.480 --> 00:04:03.760
They're eating fried potatoes.

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:07.390
And sour pork, but avoiding the slices of radish.

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:08.890
What beautiful chopstick handling technique.

00:04:08.890 --> 00:04:10.890
Thanks for the meal.

00:04:11.460 --> 00:04:15.400
Unexpectedly, it feels kinda good
to be the center of attention.

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:19.530
So what she meant by treating me, is a free
meal at the cafeteria for outer-court disciples?

00:04:19.970 --> 00:04:23.780
In a way that's almost as shameless
as me. This should be fun.

00:04:25.810 --> 00:04:26.780
It's not bed time yet.

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:29.390
We've got some aptitude tests to go through.

00:04:29.390 --> 00:04:32.410
There's homework at the Reiken Sect too?

00:04:33.010 --> 00:04:38.170
I'm not asking you to study outdated
information from the normal world.

00:04:38.970 --> 00:04:43.140
This test's design is the result
of hundreds of years of improvement.

00:04:43.140 --> 00:04:44.680
Try your best.

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:56.940
<i>He's doing great, and is going at a good speed
even though his previous knowledge is useless.</i>

00:04:57.530 --> 00:05:00.140
<i>This kid is indeed talented.</i>

00:05:00.140 --> 00:05:02.690
I expected nothing less from a kid
with a Celestial Spirit Base.

00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:07.450
Why do you want to get into cultivation?

00:05:07.820 --> 00:05:09.920
To become a deity.

00:05:09.920 --> 00:05:15.010
That's just an aspiration, almost
no one can really achieve that.

00:05:15.010 --> 00:05:17.950
Then to prolong my lifespan?

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:27.590
The oldest person in the current world of cultivation
is on Kunlun Mountain, at the age of 3590.

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:30.250
He's nothing more than a research specimen now.

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:31.350
You want to become something like that?

00:05:32.640 --> 00:05:36.060
To tell you the truth, there's no
right answer to this question.

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:37.850
Are you messing with me?

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:42.540
What I'm trying to say is,
no matter what your goal is,

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:46.200
there's one thing that you must achieve first.

00:05:48.040 --> 00:05:51.920
That is to become rock hard,
harder and even harder!

00:05:51.920 --> 00:05:54.500
Oh stop it, your dirty jokes are making me blush.

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:57.070
I was talking about your life and cultivation.

00:05:57.070 --> 00:05:58.250
Right.

00:05:58.940 --> 00:06:02.090
You will always have to overcome
hardships predetermined by fate,

00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:05.060
no matter what stage you're at.

00:06:05.060 --> 00:06:09.890
So remember one thing,
don't die, and try to survive first.

00:06:10.600 --> 00:06:15.020
On top of that, your greatest
challenges will be from your enemies.

00:06:15.840 --> 00:06:20.980
Although the Sect Alliance is in
governance, the crime rate is still high.

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:26.030
Not only in the small sects, there are dirty
scoundrels in even the most famous of sects.

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:31.840
The most important thing is always
a rock hard, impregnable will.

00:06:31.840 --> 00:06:38.350
Strength and speed are all pointless if you die.

00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:43.000
All right, your cultivation starts tomorrow.

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:50.450
Let us paint the sky with a rainbow of colors

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:10.040
Reikenzan: Hoshikuzu-tachi no Utage

00:07:12.880 --> 00:07:20.580
We drew a scribbled map of the future with no defined end

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:27.280
But you smiled saying, "no matter how lost we get,

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:30.800
or how much we cry, the end will come"

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:37.960
If tomorrow was an untouched white canvas

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:43.670
I'd like to see what kind of colors would shine the brightest

00:07:43.760 --> 00:07:48.020
Like tears leaving behind a rainbow

00:07:48.260 --> 00:07:53.960
I'll prove to you I can change this world

00:07:54.090 --> 00:07:58.290
Let us paint the sky with a rainbow of colors

00:07:58.540 --> 00:08:01.330
Listening to the footsteps of a tomorrow

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:05.510
whose name we've yet to know

00:08:14.790 --> 00:08:17.930
Seasons change, and two years have passed.

00:08:38.630 --> 00:08:40.200
She's already home.

00:08:42.590 --> 00:08:43.750
Ugh, this stench of alcohol.

00:08:44.390 --> 00:08:47.790
Completely wasted.

00:08:48.890 --> 00:08:54.110
Drinking this expensive divine alcohol again,
did she borrow money from the Chief?

00:08:57.880 --> 00:09:02.400
Guess my allowance for this month
has also gone into that alcohol.

00:09:03.350 --> 00:09:07.720
This medicine bath has been part of
Oriku's routine for the last two years.

00:09:07.720 --> 00:09:15.420
It's effects are unknown, but Oriku always
takes one after a long morning run.

00:09:15.420 --> 00:09:23.790
Aside from that, Oriku joins other disciples
in the Cloud Crossing Halls at Carefree Peak,

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:27.840
to take the lessons in math, minor languages,

00:09:27.840 --> 00:09:31.800
history of the Nine Regions,
and mechanisms of cultivation.

00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:37.970
Which are the basics taught to
every disciple of the Reiken Sect.

00:09:38.900 --> 00:09:43.740
I don't like how even though he's still at
the Kinesthetic Stage, he does so well academically.

00:09:43.740 --> 00:09:49.400
No wonder he got the elders' endorsement and became a Legacy Disciple.

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:52.270
Elder Obu is so beautiful, and that body...

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:56.200
Does she teach him other things too?

00:09:56.680 --> 00:10:00.430
As for me, I'd love to become the Legacy
Disciple of Elder Kaun who's got a nice body,

00:10:00.430 --> 00:10:03.490
plus she's easy to talk to.

00:10:03.850 --> 00:10:09.000
Everyone, are you excited to finally start our
lesson on the history of the Nine Regions?

00:10:09.410 --> 00:10:13.030
Yes, Kaun-sensei! We love you!

00:10:13.030 --> 00:10:18.880
I'm so happy that you take interest
in such a boring subject like history.

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:20.760
Let's get started then.

00:10:21.150 --> 00:10:24.060
It's so rewarding to take Kaun-sensei's class,

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:26.270
that we even repeated a grade!

00:10:27.260 --> 00:10:29.770
No one showed up today either.

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:33.740
Last time I debriefed the end
of the most recent glorious age,

00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:36.820
and the unfortunate lives of some cultivators.

00:10:37.380 --> 00:10:39.280
The next chapter will be on the Age of Mappo.

00:10:39.930 --> 00:10:43.530
This part of history is a bit depressing.

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:49.460
Famous cultivators you're familiar with like Borai
and Master Myoji all passed away during this time.

00:10:50.420 --> 00:10:54.550
The reason for the Age of Mappo is still unknown.

00:10:54.550 --> 00:11:00.220
And the developments were
too vast to all be recorded.

00:11:01.020 --> 00:11:06.390
6000 years ago, the divine Ki of the Nine
Regions went through a tumultuous time.

00:11:06.390 --> 00:11:08.960
Cultivators of the higher stages got hit the hardest.

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:16.360
This came as a result of the constant
communication they had with the divine Ki.

00:11:17.300 --> 00:11:22.820
The Age of Mappo lasted for 200 years, until
the divine Ki of the world suddenly depleted,

00:11:22.820 --> 00:11:25.450
and totally changed the face of cultivation.

00:11:26.500 --> 00:11:31.610
Guess we should speed up a bit and
get through this gloomy chapter after all.

00:11:31.610 --> 00:11:37.590
In short, for cultivators,
more power meant more affliction.

00:11:37.590 --> 00:11:45.220
For example, the famous master Sekion
went mad due to the depletion of the divine Ki.

00:11:45.570 --> 00:11:50.140
There were many other cultivators
who went mad after that era.

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:56.450
Many gave up on advancing
in their stages of cultivation,

00:11:56.450 --> 00:12:05.240
and a lot of upper-class techniques were
abandoned, eventually becoming lost in time.

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:11.870
Next time we'll talk about the Age
of Recovery, be sure to prep for it.

00:12:12.270 --> 00:12:16.540
The latter half was nothing but
reading the names of the dead.

00:12:16.540 --> 00:12:24.130
I heard that when Elder Obu taught this
lesson she used illusions to demonstrate.

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:25.070
For real?

00:12:25.070 --> 00:12:29.640
I heard about that too. There was a disciple at the Pseudo-Tan stage who fainted.

00:12:30.250 --> 00:12:32.520
Anyway let's grab some food.

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:35.430
You mean at the Carefree Peak,
the cafeteria for outer-court disciples right?

00:12:35.430 --> 00:12:39.180
Obviously! I shudder at the thought of Ethereal Peak.

00:12:41.250 --> 00:12:49.280
Oriku eventually got tired of being treated
like a celebrity at the outer-court cafeteria.

00:12:50.280 --> 00:12:54.650
After the pass expired, Obu gave him the pass

00:12:54.650 --> 00:12:58.040
for the inner-court disciple cafeteria at Ethereal Peak.

00:12:59.730 --> 00:13:01.620
What's today's menu?

00:13:01.620 --> 00:13:04.910
Frog eggs with lamb intestines,
banana doused in fish oil,

00:13:04.910 --> 00:13:07.300
or is it perhaps surströmming pudding?

00:13:08.200 --> 00:13:13.730
Elder Ryuken hired a chef from
the west, who made a dish based

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:19.690
on the concept of the Chief's Stellar Peak, and called it "Stargazey Pie."

00:13:20.350 --> 00:13:22.780
It was so bad, that after the elders ate it,

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:29.990
their faces started to resemble the dead
fish heads placed on top of the pies.

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:36.830
Bunho, you need to value your life, man.

00:13:38.860 --> 00:13:41.610
Thanks for coming again.

00:13:41.610 --> 00:13:44.590
I feel confident seeing how
much you like my food.

00:13:45.260 --> 00:13:48.340
Makes me want to try new recipes.

00:13:49.630 --> 00:13:52.030
Oh I'm so sorry, I didn't notice.

00:13:52.030 --> 00:13:54.600
There's still a lot left, you can
eat as much as you want.

00:13:56.220 --> 00:13:58.350
You're making it worse for yourself.

00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:08.820
I figured it's about time you started
pining for the food from Ryoka Inn.

00:14:09.170 --> 00:14:12.370
Pork cutlet! I mean, Rei-san!

00:14:14.280 --> 00:14:17.300
So how's your cultivation going?

00:14:17.300 --> 00:14:20.960
I was about to ask you how the inn
is running without you there?

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:26.380
The guys I hired two years ago
finally started making food up to par.

00:14:26.980 --> 00:14:29.380
So I leave them in charge every now and then.

00:14:29.690 --> 00:14:32.310
I'm surprised you have
the budget to hire more people.

00:14:32.310 --> 00:14:35.650
Oh yeah, maybe it's the money
from those radishes we sold.

00:14:35.650 --> 00:14:37.890
So how's your gay partner?

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:42.540
I told you, Kai-chan is just a friend.

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:46.650
We've been writing each other for two years.

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:53.090
Kai-chan was able to gather Ki
in his body the first year.

00:14:53.090 --> 00:14:54.620
In the letter I read yesterday he said,

00:14:55.380 --> 00:15:00.030
<i>I finally surpassed the 7th tier
of the Ki-Gathering Stage.</i>

00:15:00.030 --> 00:15:04.990
<i>The way of the Manpo Sect really is
perfect for uncommon spirit bases.</i>

00:15:04.990 --> 00:15:08.300
<i>I can utilize 100% of my potential here.</i>

00:15:09.230 --> 00:15:14.010
<i>How I wish I could share
this joy with you, in person.</i>

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:17.650
Sounds like nothing but showing off to me.

00:15:17.650 --> 00:15:21.070
I'm sure your gay partner meant well.

00:15:21.070 --> 00:15:26.280
Well, compared to them, our inner-court
disciples are really behind.

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:31.980
The top of the class, Shushin, is only
starting to learn to gather Ki in his body.

00:15:31.980 --> 00:15:37.540
Which is still leaps and bounds ahead of someone
who can only do long-distance running.

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:42.830
At least I get top scores in the foundation courses.

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:47.750
That's what you always say,
but you know things aren't that simple.

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:53.000
My plan is, 3 years for the Ki Gathering Stage,
3 years of the Foundation Stage,

00:15:53.000 --> 00:15:54.540
and another 3 years of the Pseudo-Dan stage.

00:15:54.540 --> 00:15:59.770
I should be able to reach the JinDan Stage after
10 years and blow Shushin out of the water.

00:16:00.460 --> 00:16:03.880
Why does the Reiken Sect have
the Kinesthetic Stage before all that?

00:16:03.880 --> 00:16:10.650
Don't skimp on body building, you'll gain
even more if you can learn some martial arts.

00:16:11.260 --> 00:16:15.660
And what my long-distance running and medicinal bath have to do with all this, is beyond me.

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:18.700
Let me teach you some martial arts then,

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:23.430
since you're still at the Kinesthetic Stage. It's a perfectly normal technique.

00:16:23.430 --> 00:16:26.370
Would it negatively affect my future stages?

00:16:26.370 --> 00:16:30.510
Rest assured, my techniques
won't affect any of that.

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:32.210
Let me bow to my new teacher!

00:16:32.210 --> 00:16:33.470
Cut it out!

00:16:35.650 --> 00:16:37.500
You sure run fast.

00:16:37.500 --> 00:16:40.300
Well I've been training for two years.

00:16:40.300 --> 00:16:42.810
Then can you keep up with my pace?

00:16:47.840 --> 00:16:50.630
I didn't know there was a place like this here.

00:16:50.630 --> 00:16:54.300
The red autumn leaves stay here all year round.

00:16:54.300 --> 00:16:55.490
Isn't it cool?

00:16:56.220 --> 00:17:00.600
Okay, for starters, let me teach you
the "Dragon Subduing Palms" technique.

00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:03.540
There are only 16 sets, very easy to learn.

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:10.420
First steady your breath, concentrate
your Ki, and imagine a dragon...

00:17:15.930 --> 00:17:17.980
Easy enough, right?

00:17:17.980 --> 00:17:20.720
I can't even think, my mind is so blown right now.

00:17:21.220 --> 00:17:23.400
Were you really paying attention?

00:17:23.400 --> 00:17:27.410
I can't even gather Ki yet,
how am I supposed to do that?

00:17:27.410 --> 00:17:29.680
Don't you have any techniques for beginners?

00:17:29.680 --> 00:17:33.750
Idiot, don't be expecting anymore food from me.

00:17:33.750 --> 00:17:35.700
Don't coerce me with food!

00:17:36.090 --> 00:17:39.290
You should be grateful that
I even showed you that technique.

00:17:39.290 --> 00:17:42.330
I'll bring you the divine grass
next time as an apology.

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:45.460
So please teach me how to gather Ki first.

00:17:46.320 --> 00:17:48.460
I guess I'll have to if you keep insisting.

00:17:50.230 --> 00:17:53.710
First, try your best to imitate me.

00:17:54.160 --> 00:17:57.470
Did the martial arts always
have such embarrassing poses?

00:17:58.010 --> 00:18:00.330
Your body is really flexible.

00:18:00.330 --> 00:18:01.850
This is really painful.

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:04.970
Match your breathing with mine.

00:18:06.570 --> 00:18:10.940
Synchronize every part of your body.

00:18:11.910 --> 00:18:14.440
Don't you feel an inkling
of the presence of Ki?

00:18:15.250 --> 00:18:19.950
If your breathing is right,
you should feel it moving.

00:18:20.490 --> 00:18:25.270
I can feel it, various kinds of Ki
moving throughout my body.

00:18:25.270 --> 00:18:27.870
As if it's coursing through my muscles and veins.

00:18:28.970 --> 00:18:33.760
It feels like I can tap into 100%
of my muscle strength.

00:18:33.760 --> 00:18:34.630
Amazing!

00:18:43.730 --> 00:18:46.560
This is so exhausting.

00:18:47.770 --> 00:18:53.070
According to Rei-san, if I practice it twice a day,
once in the morning and once in the evening,

00:18:53.500 --> 00:18:55.950
I should be able to catch up to Shushin in a month.

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:05.310
She's out drinking again?

00:19:05.310 --> 00:19:09.250
It really is a waste of time being her disciple.

00:19:13.090 --> 00:19:14.580
Ouch...

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:16.980
I feel so heavy,

00:19:16.980 --> 00:19:19.720
did I practice too hard yesterday?

00:19:23.090 --> 00:19:25.020
What is this?

00:19:30.540 --> 00:19:32.730
So this is what they call hitting puberty...

00:19:33.040 --> 00:19:35.520
Get out of my bed if you're already awake!

00:19:36.020 --> 00:19:38.890
I was just teaching you how
to resist your carnal desires.

00:19:38.890 --> 00:19:41.780
Didn't you just fall into the wrong
bed because you were too drunk?

00:19:42.970 --> 00:19:45.280
Riku-chan, you're heading out?

00:19:45.280 --> 00:19:46.620
Yeah, morning practice.

00:19:47.260 --> 00:19:48.820
Practice for what?

00:19:48.820 --> 00:19:51.420
There are no lessons in Cloud Crossing Hall today.

00:19:51.420 --> 00:19:53.100
Martial arts for normal people.

00:19:53.100 --> 00:19:56.650
Martial arts? Who taught you that?

00:19:56.650 --> 00:19:58.760
Some master I met in the mountains.

00:19:59.440 --> 00:20:05.640
She took pity on me, who after two years
of training, can only beat a monkey at running.

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:09.830
This is like being presented with
the hottest person in the world,

00:20:09.830 --> 00:20:12.140
and choosing porn instead of real sex with her!

00:20:12.670 --> 00:20:17.350
Riku-chan, did you eat so much
Stargazey Pie that you got sick?

00:20:17.350 --> 00:20:20.150
You're the one who gave me the pass to eat there!

00:20:20.690 --> 00:20:26.120
I learned more in one day, than what
I learned following you for two years.

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:27.500
You should be ashamed of yourself.

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:29.410
What if he's a con man?

00:20:29.690 --> 00:20:32.410
At least she's a con man
with topnotch techniques.

00:20:32.870 --> 00:20:37.840
So you don't believe in my techniques, is that it?

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:40.270
Bring your con master here,

00:20:40.270 --> 00:20:43.680
if I lose to her, you can do as you please.

00:20:46.440 --> 00:20:48.460
...And that's what happened.

00:20:48.460 --> 00:20:50.190
So you took the bet?

00:20:50.190 --> 00:20:51.480
Yes.

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:52.550
You should head back now.

00:20:52.550 --> 00:20:53.780
Oh c'mon now.

00:20:53.780 --> 00:20:56.560
She promised not to use any spells,
and only fight using the martial arts.

00:20:56.940 --> 00:21:00.590
She won't make a bet she
can't win, that's how she is.

00:21:00.590 --> 00:21:03.480
Plus she's at the stage of JinDan.

00:21:03.480 --> 00:21:07.210
She can beat a normal person with ease, even without using any spells.

00:21:07.210 --> 00:21:11.490
I've known for a while now that
Rei-san isn't just some normal person.

00:21:14.640 --> 00:21:18.300
It's not like I wanted to go against her like this.

00:21:18.300 --> 00:21:22.800
But she said the one that taught me martial arts must be an uneducated and uncouth, man-hulk like psycho.

00:21:23.550 --> 00:21:32.870
Who has no chance with any man ever, or even a les partner for that matter.

00:21:32.870 --> 00:21:36.460
And after passing the age of 30 will have nothing
to do but kill time with their fingers and cucumbers.

00:21:36.460 --> 00:21:38.980
Eventually, she'll buy a big butter dog...

00:21:40.880 --> 00:21:42.780
Let's go right now.

00:21:42.780 --> 00:21:46.820
If I don't beat the hell outta that damn woman today, I'll shut this inn down.

00:22:17.980 --> 00:22:23.700
The beat that quivers
within my worn down memory,

00:22:24.130 --> 00:22:27.170
Drowns in my slumber,

00:22:27.340 --> 00:22:29.010
sinking below the surface

00:22:29.310 --> 00:22:35.030
My eyes, as they
look up to a pouring sky

00:22:35.420 --> 00:22:40.430
Reflect a heart locked
away by the moonlight

00:22:40.770 --> 00:22:51.280
Only my most twisted pain
lies within this weaving infinity

00:22:51.510 --> 00:22:57.720
Bleeding away miserably
as our intertwined fingers untangle

00:22:58.060 --> 00:23:01.450
Clinging to your feelings,

00:23:01.730 --> 00:23:04.650
oh so powerfully

00:23:05.040 --> 00:23:10.210
I'll show you I can go
beyond this rusted world

00:23:10.740 --> 00:23:15.800
The words that pierced
through this permanent illusion

00:23:16.060 --> 00:23:25.900
Resound through my out stretched fingers

00:23:35.880 --> 00:23:37.800
"Amorphic Bones, Version 98".

00:23:37.800 --> 00:23:39.580
Waiting for you at the Reiken Mountain.
